4
00:11.890 --> 00:14.040
I'm here to warn you before it all goes down.

5
00:14.110 --> 00:15.080
I don't believe you.

6
00:15.210 --> 00:16.320
Every incident

7
00:16.500 --> 00:18.690
has been staged by Nine Nopphanat.

8
00:18.710 --> 00:20.920
He'll realize how many heads and lives he has used as stepping stones

9
00:21.170 --> 00:24.770
just so he could climb up to where he is.

10
00:25.430 --> 00:26.950
Falling from where I am might hurt,

11
00:27.690 --> 00:29.150
but I won't be embarrassed.

12
00:29.170 --> 00:30.450
Please don't go, Nine.

13
00:30.610 --> 00:31.700
Stay with me.

14
00:32.710 --> 00:34.050
Don't go...

15
00:34.530 --> 00:35.950
Is this it, Third?

16
00:35.980 --> 00:37.640
Is this what we wanted?

17
01:00.180 --> 01:00.970
Hmph,

18
01:02.110 --> 01:03.710
are you gonna lie around and do nothing every day?

19
01:04.500 --> 01:05.850
Get up and find something to do.

20
01:07.110 --> 01:08.060
Mm...

21
01:09.120 --> 01:10.380
Are you my sister or my mom?

22
01:10.400 --> 01:11.570
How fucking harsh...

23
01:12.060 --> 01:12.980
Mom isn't harsh.

24
01:13.000 --> 01:14.360
I'm the harsh one.

25
01:14.580 --> 01:15.990
Money doesn't grow on trees.

26
01:16.240 --> 01:18.660
If you don't work, how the fuck will you be able to afford food?

27
01:20.780 --> 01:24.500
I just want to live an ordinary life like an ordinary person.

28
01:26.190 --> 01:28.280
Plus, I don't even know what I should do.

29
01:28.460 --> 01:29.400
How about photography gigs?

30
01:29.550 --> 01:31.000
What if someone recognizes me?

31
01:31.220 --> 01:32.320
Be an actor, then.

32
01:32.630 --> 01:34.160
Nuh-uh. No...

33
01:34.180 --> 01:36.600
Just pick one. Anything at all.

34
01:36.759 --> 01:38.140
You can't just sprawl there like a log.

35
01:38.160 --> 01:40.160
Canned fish again today?

36
01:43.380 --> 01:44.000
I'm...

37
01:44.020 --> 01:44.509
sick of...

38
01:44.530 --> 01:45.840
canned fish!

39
01:50.710 --> 01:52.009
You're one lucky bastard.

40
01:56.479 --> 01:57.680
Hi, girlie.

41
01:58.270 --> 01:59.380
Oh, girlie.

42
01:59.400 --> 02:01.070
It's been a while. I missed you.

43
02:01.090 --> 02:01.970
I missed you, too.

44
02:01.990 --> 02:02.840
Where's Wan?

45
02:16.160 --> 02:17.060
Hi, Wan.

46
02:17.350 --> 02:18.890
Hello, Cher...

47
02:22.110 --> 02:23.370
I'm here today

48
02:24.300 --> 02:25.940
because I have a favor to ask.

49
02:25.960 --> 02:26.990
If it's about money,

50
02:27.010 --> 02:28.329
we'll have to pass, girlie.

51
02:28.350 --> 02:29.240
We've been short on cash lately.

52
02:31.340 --> 02:33.120
I'm here to ask you

53
02:33.630 --> 02:34.760
