54
02:35.020 --> 02:35.910
No way.

55
02:35.930 --> 02:36.520
For 5,000 baht.

56
02:39.440 --> 02:40.240
Seriously?!

57
02:43.140 --> 02:44.500
Go. We're short on money.

58
02:51.240 --> 02:52.000
8,000.

59
02:53.770 --> 02:54.480
Take it!

60
03:04.620 --> 03:05.920
10,000. Wired immediately.

61
03:13.430 --> 03:14.430
You bet.

62
03:14.950 --> 03:16.000
You have to pay up first, though.

63
03:19.740 --> 03:21.040
Tips will be appreciated.

