104
04:48.890 --> 04:50.280
Can you take care of this little thing?

105
04:51.600 --> 04:53.290
Can you take care of this small problem?

106
04:53.510 --> 04:55.780
If you can't get it sorted, just quit!

107
04:56.470 --> 04:57.470
You stupid fool!

108
04:58.790 --> 05:00.060
Real stupid!

109
05:01.560 --> 05:03.650
Why am I always surrounded by idiots?

110
05:04.840 --> 05:06.120
Good thing you came.

111
05:06.740 --> 05:08.670
Go discipline those staff.

112
05:09.030 --> 05:11.120
Such an incompetent bunch.

113
05:11.760 --> 05:12.710
Pitch,

114
05:12.980 --> 05:14.920
may I say a little something?

115
05:15.940 --> 05:16.560
What?

116
05:17.870 --> 05:20.790
I think you need to stop letting your emotions take over during work,

117
05:21.490 --> 05:23.520
or you'd never be able to beat Wut.

118
05:24.820 --> 05:26.080
If Wut was still here,

119
05:26.960 --> 05:28.670
