120
05:28.690 --> 05:29.780
And what do you want me to do?

121
05:29.800 --> 05:31.670
How about you stop solving your own inferiority,

122
05:32.550 --> 05:34.050
pay attention to your company,

123
05:34.900 --> 05:36.250
and spend the rest of your time

124
05:36.530 --> 05:37.800
