125
05:37.890 --> 05:39.920
You take care of the kids, then.

126
05:40.060 --> 05:41.640
So you'll know it's not fucking easy!

127
05:41.720 --> 05:42.880
Too late.

128
05:43.440 --> 05:44.560
No Third,

129
05:44.580 --> 05:45.640
no Nine,

130
05:46.040 --> 05:47.840
no Sunny.

131
05:49.010 --> 05:50.360
No matter how much I love the kids

132
05:50.580 --> 05:51.840
and your company,

133
05:52.390 --> 05:53.720
if this is how you're fucking running it,

134
05:54.050 --> 05:55.370
I quit,

135
05:55.850 --> 05:56.800
you fucking boomer.

136
05:57.250 --> 05:58.430
Ungrateful!

137
06:00.580 --> 06:01.270
Right.

138
06:02.950 --> 06:04.720
If that fucking flowerpot hairstyle of yours

139
06:04.950 --> 06:07.400
doesn't help with company management,

140
06:07.690 --> 06:09.870
I suggest you shave it off completely,

141
06:10.230 --> 06:10.970
you fucking moron!

142
06:11.640 --> 06:13.170
Sunny, you bitch!

143
06:13.190 --> 06:14.700
How is my hair any of your fucking concern?

144
06:14.850 --> 06:16.730
Come back here, bitch!

145
06:16.750 --> 06:18.470
Sunny, you fucking ingrate!

146
